# The Chromium revision this change set is generated against (upstream commit
# "Allow ServiceWorkerAutoPreload on clients having declarativeNetRequest",
# 2026-08-26). scripts/apply.sh refuses any other HEAD unless
# CAMOU_PIN_OVERRIDE=1 is set (the rebase drill sets it deliberately; nothing
# else should).
#
# Not to be confused with a727b57805: that is the tip of the build box's
# camoucrome/sp5a branch, whose committed history holds sp0-sp2b on top of this
# base and whose working tree carries the rest of the patch stack uncommitted.
# The docs called it "the Chromium revision" until 2026-09-09, when applying the
# stack onto a worktree at a727b57805 conflicted on sp0 and exposed the mix-up.
CHROMIUM_REV=0e8d4a9268118d323f62ca207b40514df39dcaa9
